<header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href={`${base}/`} aria-label="The Evolution of Bikes, forside"><span class="brand-mark">E<span>B</span></span><span>The Evolution<br/>of Bikes</span></a><nav aria-label="Hovedmenu"><a href={`${base}/historier/`} aria-current="page">Historier</a><a href={`${base}/perioder/`}>Perioder</a><a href={`${base}/cykler/`}>Cykler</a><a href={`${base}/om/`}>Om</a></nav><div class="header-tools"><strong>DA</strong><span>/</span><a class="language-switch" href={`${base}/en/stories/${slug}/`} lang="en">EN</a><a class="header-story-link" href={`${base}/fortael-din-historie/`}>Fortæl din historie</a></div></header><main><article class="track-page"><header class="track-hero"><p class="section-label">Paris–Roubaix · 1934</p><h1>{title}</h1><p>{description}</p></header><figure class="hero-image"><OptimizedImage src={lapebieImage} alt="Roger Lapébie står med sin cykel blandt ryttere og tilskuere ved cykelkontrollen før Paris–Roubaix 1934" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Roger Lapébie ved kontrollen af cyklerne i gården hos avisen <em>L’Auto</em>, 31. marts 1934. Foto: Agence Rol / Bibliothèque nationale de France, public domain.</figcaption></figure><div class="story-copy"><p class="lead">{description}</p>{sections.map(([heading,text])=><section><h2>{heading}</h2><p>{text}</p></section>)}</div><section class="period-sources"><p class="section-label">Kilder</p><div><ul>{sources.map(([label,url])=><li><a href={url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{label}</a></li>)}</ul></div></section><RelatedDiscovery currentSlug={slug}/><nav class="era-bottom-nav" aria-label="Videre navigation"><a href={`${base}/historier/`}>← Alle historier</a><a href={`${base}/perioder/1930-1939/`}>Perioden 1930–1939 →</a></nav></article></main><footer><div class="brand footer-brand"><span class="brand-mark">E<span>B</span></span><span>The Evolution<br/>of Bikes</span></div><p>En personlig samling af vintagecykler,<br/>historier, mærker og komponenter.</p><p class="copyright">© {new Date().getFullYear()} The Evolution of Bikes</p></footer></body></html>
